[Init]

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>The Rescue</h2>
<i>~I"We don't build bridges to make peace."<br>
~.--General Jan Masaryk</i>
<p>Your night sentries have been bribed. You wake the next morning with a call of distress from the Researcher, who you were giving safe passage to the skies of saalrum 'ta. ~I"I am in dire need of your assistance, please save me,!" ~.You look around. You are under attack and almost completely surrounded. This is gonna be a tough fight</p>
$Button=Make it easier,SetAllBridge,0
$Button=Normal setting,SetAllBridge,1
$Button=I am a Netstorm God,SetAllBridge,2



[ai2PriestSaved]
You have saved a friend of the lord of <?{vn_windall}>Wind</?><?!{vn_windall}>Rain</?> ~.You have done well. You are rewarded with the tech of the outpost.
$Menu=~[Ioutpost.*],tell,win

[win]
<$GetTechnology,126>
<$Config,vn_donevn8=1>
<?{vn_windall}><$Config,vn_tech="windBattery;windArcher;windAviary;sunFence;windWalker;outpost;"></?>
<?!{vn_windall}><$Config,vn_tech="rainBattery;rainCannon;rainAviary;sunFence;rainWalker;outpost;"></?>
$Button=NextMission,MissionBegin,vn6

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>Victory!</h2>
<p>Again you have proved your formidable abilities in battle. Tonight there will be much rejoicing.
You are rewarded with the tech of the outpost.
$Menu=~[Ioutpost.*],tell,win

